error[DS0002]: unterminated string
  --> query:1:21
  |
1 | from t | where s == 'abc
  |                     ^^^^ this string is never closed
  |
  = help: add a closing `'` at the end of the string
  = note: a string ends at the end of its line

error[DS0003]: `datetime(` is never closed
  --> query:3:13
  |
3 | | where d > datetime(2024-01-01
  |             ^^^^^^^^^ this literal has no closing `)` on this line
  |
  = help: close it with `)`: `datetime(2024-01-01)`
